  "title": "MIKASA-Robo-VLA: Benchmarking Memory in VLA Models for Long-Horizon Manipulation",
  "summary": "This report introduces MIKASA-Robo-VLA, a benchmark of 90 language-conditioned manipulation tasks designed to evaluate memory in VLA models for long-term manipulation. The framework uses a combination of reactive controls and memory-dependent tasks to assess how well memory supports long-term planning and execution of actions.",
